WEBVTT

00:01.040 --> 00:02.440
After the north fell

00:03.320 --> 00:05.480
Many Xuan people surrendered to the Wuzhao

00:05.560 --> 00:06.440
These people likely

00:06.520 --> 00:07.760
Are mixed in with the volunteers

00:07.840 --> 00:09.240
Hoping to gain merit

00:09.320 --> 00:10.987
To please their Wuzhao masters

00:11.600 --> 00:12.920
If you put it that way

00:13.000 --> 00:14.080
In the north

00:14.160 --> 00:16.320
What force is completely trustworthy?

00:21.000 --> 00:23.000
Your Highness being cautious

00:23.240 --> 00:24.640
Is always good

00:25.400 --> 00:26.800
But
